{"strongs": "H8535", "word": "תָּם", "translit": "tam", "root": "תלע", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "complete", "definition": "תָּם adjective complete — ׳ ת Gen 25:27 + 10 t.; suffix תַּמָּתִי Song 5:2 ; Song 6:9 (late, except Gen 25:27 ); — 1. complete, perfect: in beauty Song 5:2 ; Song 6:9 of physical strength Ps 73:4 (read לָ֑מוֺ תָּם Ew De Dr Sam. xxxi Che Bae and others). 2. sound, wholesome: אישׁ תָּם , of Jacob as tent-dweller, opposed to Esau, hunter, Gen 25:27 ( J ; De leutseliger Mann , Di ruhig, still , AV RV plain man ; ׳ ת here possibly redactional, = 3 ). 3. complete, morally innocent, having integrity: אִישׁ תָּם Job 1:8 ; Job 2:3 ׳ ת alone Job 1:1 ; Job 8:20 ; Job 9:20 ; Job 9:21 ; Job 9:22 ; Prov 29:10 ; Ps 37:37 ; Ps 64:5 . — תַּמִּים see [ תָּאם ]. p. 1060f", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9192')\">BDB9192</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8535')\">H8535</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H8382')\">H8382</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9191')\">BDB9191</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9193')\">BDB9193</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>תָּם</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>complete</highlightword> — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 25:27\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(1,25,27)\">Gen 25:27</ref> + 10 t.; suffix <bdbheb>תַּמָּתִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Song 5:2\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(22,5,2)\">Song 5:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 6:9\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(22,6,9)\">Song 6:9</ref> (late, except <ref ref=\"Gen 25:27\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(1,25,27)\">Gen 25:27</ref>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>complete, perfect:</highlight> in beauty <ref ref=\"Song 5:2\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(22,5,2)\">Song 5:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 6:9\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(22,6,9)\">Song 6:9</ref> of physical strength <ref ref=\"Ps 73:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"73\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"73\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,73,4)\">Ps 73:4</ref> (read <bdbheb>לָ֑מוֺ תָּם</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup>Sam. xxxi</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bae')\">Bae</lookup> and others). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>sound, wholesome:</highlight> <bdbheb>אישׁ תָּם</bdbheb>, of Jacob as tent-dweller, opposed to Esau, hunter, <ref ref=\"Gen 25:27\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(1,25,27)\">Gen 25:27</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('De')\">De</lookup> <highlight>leutseliger Mann</highlight>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> <highlight>ruhig, still</highlight>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('AV')\"><reflink>AV</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RV')\"><reflink>RV</reflink></lookup> <highlight>plain man</highlight>; <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ת</bdbheb> here possibly redactional, = <b>3</b>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>complete, morally innocent, having integrity:</highlight> <bdbheb>אִישׁ תָּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 1:8\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(18,1,8)\">Job 1:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 2:3\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(18,2,3)\">Job 2:3</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ת</bdbheb> alone <ref ref=\"Job 1:1\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(18,1,1)\">Job 1:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 8:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(18,8,20)\">Job 8:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 9:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"9